  "sourceText": "Sausage Dip\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 1:11pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 pound Ground meat\n2 pounds Velveeta cheese\n1 can Ro-Tel tomatoes\n2 Chili peppers, chopped\n1 pound Ground sausage\n1 Onion, minced\n1 can Cream of mushroom soup\n1 teaspoon Garlic powder\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cook meat and add chunks of cheese and melt. Add the rest of the ingredients and mix well. Serve hot.",
